{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40512","headline":"邹律 · 苏拯","name":"邹律","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"邹律暖燕谷，青史徒编录。\n人心不变迁，空吹闲草木。\n世患有三惑，尔律莫能抑。\n边苦有长征，尔律莫能息。\n斯术未济时，斯律亦何益。\n争如至公一开口，吹起贤良霸邦国。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏拯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40512.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40512","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}